Node ID=900 order inquisition high
Text=The pyres of the Inquisition would burn on, for a frightened world gives its inquisitors more work, not less. They would call the Cataclysm a judgement and the next one a warning, and they would be believed. The Lion had risen high in the Holy Office, high enough that when the fires were lit, some of the smoke was the Lion's.
