Node ID=900 order saladin high
Text=In the east, the Knights of Saladin would hold to the pact that the west let slip, and they would hold to it alone for a long while. Their patience would be mistaken for weakness by men who had never seen them fight. The Lion had been named a Favored One, and the Prophet's faithful would tell of a western scion who kept faith with the east when the west did not.
