Node ID=900 order wielder high
Text=La Calle Perdida would not be found, not by the Inquisition and not by the knights, and the magic the world had tried to drown would go on breathing under its streets. What the Wielders learned in hiding, they would teach in the open, in a century with more patience than this one. The Lion had been raised high among them, and a scion of Richard who chose the sorcerers over the cross would be argued about for as long as either lasted.
